# Per-Dockerfile ignore for ebpf/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads it instead of
# the shared .dockerignore for `docker build -f ebpf/Dockerfile`). The image
# builds ./ebpf/cmd/pii-shield-ebpf, which needs the ebpf module and
# pkg/ from the root module; everything else stays out of the context.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!pkg
!ebpf
ebpf/pii-shield-ebpf
ebpf/Dockerfile
ebpf/Dockerfile.dockerignore
